ee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (3/10).","financial_summary":["American Airlines Group, Inc. is a mid-cap industrials business with a $8.7B market cap on $54.6B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +4% over the past three years and +3% annually across the full decade, which puts it in mature, slow-growth territory.","Returns on capital run at 5% against a 7% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $680M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 7.9\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and thin 0.9\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and profit capture is only 0.2\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.7) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (15.8% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Significant insider selling (net $5.7M)","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","dollars":-5669689.27},{"text":"Carries more leverage than most Industrials peers \u2014 a smaller cushion for the inevitable bad year","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"Industrials sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 8% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Industrials ETF trading well below its long-term trend","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cyclical sectors like Industrials tend to underperform in slowdowns","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Tariff and trade-policy exposure \u2014 industrial exporters sit squarely in the crosshairs of protectionist policy, and retaliatory tariffs can close markets without warning.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"news_headlines":[{"title":"$600K Electronic Airline Scam Lands Florida Man In Federal Prison","source":"slashgear.com","link":"https://www.slashgear.com/2308634/florida-airline-scam-federal-prison-sentence/","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1794003300.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.898,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"PSA Pilots Secure Contract Extension Through 2030","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/small-business/articles/psa-pilots-secure-contract-extension-211028886.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793999428.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.637,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":["product"]},{"title":"MyFlyYatra Makes New York to Europe Business Class Travel More Affordable with Exclusive Flight Deals","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/small-business/articles/myflyyatra-makes-york-europe-business-204500258.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793997900.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.877,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Tillis will \u2018move heaven and Earth\u2019 to take CLT airport if city gets lease deal wrong","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/tillis-move-heaven-earth-clt-163455000.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793997762.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.052,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"U.S. State Department Confirms Passport Number Issue That Blocks Travelers' Global Entry And TSA PreCheck","sourc